listing:   firmware.elf
toolchain: QEMU emulator version 8.2.2 (Debian 1:8.2.2+ds-0ubuntu1.18)
command:   timeout 3 qemu-system-arm -M stm32vldiscovery -nographic -monitor none -serial stdio -kernel firmware.elf
date:      2026-10-09T19:30:30Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
exit code: 124 (124 = stopped by the 3 s time limit; the firmware loops forever by design)
hardware:  untested on hardware; run in QEMU's emulated STM32F100 board, not on a real chip
